remstart
    THE THINGS ON THE BOARD, IN INFO MODE
    info mode does not explain the board as a whole: the tutorial has done that. what is out of the way on
    it gets an outline of its own, on a cell: a jellyfish, a rainbow fish, a fish that is belly up, the
    coral, and so on. the words of it only say what it is, and leave what it does to be found out.

    each kind of thing gets one outline, however many of it there are, on the one nearest the cursor, so
    that the keys do not have to go through a crowd of them. the rarest are put out first, and no two share
    a cell when that can be helped. when they have to share, the outline says what each of them is.

    every fish faces one way or the other, so the way that one faces would be on half of the board. one
    fish that can be seen to face a way gets an outline for it, picked at random.

    the coral had info mode's spots of its own already, INFO_INDEX_CORAL and INFO_INDEX_CORAL_SICK, which
    the angler knows. they are two of the kinds here, and go on a cell of coral like the rest.

    boardInfoPlace, in fish_routines_boardinfo, puts them all out. info mode does it when it opens, and
    the coral does it whenever it changes.
remend

` the kinds of thing, rarest first, which is the order that they are put out in
#constant BOARD_INFO_DIVER 0
#constant BOARD_INFO_RAINBOW 1
#constant BOARD_INFO_KRILL 2
#constant BOARD_INFO_SEAWEED 3
#constant BOARD_INFO_DOLLAR 4
#constant BOARD_INFO_TURTLE 5
#constant BOARD_INFO_GLASS 6
#constant BOARD_INFO_BOTTLE 7
#constant BOARD_INFO_JELLY 8
#constant BOARD_INFO_RAY 9
#constant BOARD_INFO_MARK 10
#constant BOARD_INFO_HORROR 11
#constant BOARD_INFO_CORAL 12
#constant BOARD_INFO_BONES 13
#constant BOARD_INFO_BELLY 14
#constant BOARD_INFO_STACK 15
#constant BOARD_INFO_FACING 16
global BOARD_INFO_KINDS = 17

global dim BOARD_INFO_BLOB(17) `the blob of info mode for each kind. -1 until it is made.
global dim BOARD_INFO_CELL(17) `the cell that each one is on, or -1 when there is none of it
global dim BOARD_INFO_OWNER(400) `which kind each cell's outline is, or -1
global BOARD_INFO_READY = 0

` the words for a kind, from boardInfoWords
global BOARD_INFO_TITLE$ = ""
global BOARD_INFO_DESC$ = ""
